# The extension signing key (#36). manifest.json carries the *public* half and
# is committed; the private .pem must never be. It lives at
# ~/.thehammer/thehammer-extension-key.pem, outside the repo, and Chrome also
# drops one beside the folder when "Pack extension" is used.
*.pem
